# Our aiter-integration sub-tree ships hand-written .cmake source modules.
# The broad *.cmake ignore above was meant for generated CMake artifacts
# (cmake_install.cmake etc); negate it for our scaffolding.
!ggml/src/ggml-cuda/aiter-integration/cmake/*.cmake
.mneme-code

# perf-baseline run artifacts — keep source/results, drop the noisy logs + profiler dumps
